{"id": "16-1019-2-4", "zh": "Vapa，表示延续。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1019-5-6", "zh": "vapati（延续）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1020-2-4", "zh": "Sapa，表示聚合。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1020-5-6", "zh": "sapati（聚合）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1021-2-4", "zh": "Cupa，表示缓慢行走。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1021-5-6", "zh": "copati（缓慢行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1022-2-4", "zh": "Tupa，表示伤害。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1022-5-6", "zh": "topati（伤害）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1022-7-8", "zh": "tuppati（伤害）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1023-2-4", "zh": "Gupa，表示守护与厌恶。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1023-5-8", "zh": "gopati（守护），jigucchati（厌恶）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1023-9-12", "zh": "jigucchaṃ、jigucchamāno（正在厌恶的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1023-13-14", "zh": "jegucchī（厌恶者）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1023-15-17", "zh": "jigucchitvā（厌恶以后）等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1024-2-4", "zh": "Kapu，表示伤害、香料与香气。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-1024-5-6", "zh": "kappati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1024-7-8", "zh": "kappūro（樟脑）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1025-2-4", "zh": "Kapu，表示能够、适宜。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1025-5-8", "zh": "这对我们是适宜的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1025-9-12", "zh": "这对我们来说是不适宜的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1026-2-4", "zh": "Kapa，表示悲悯。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1026-5-6", "zh": "kapati（悲悯）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1026-7-10", "zh": "kapaṇo（可怜人），kāpaññaṃ（可怜）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1026-11-19", "zh": "这里，**kapati**就是“悲悯”的意思；kāpañña 就是可怜的状态。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1027-2-5", "zh": "Sapa，表示诅咒。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1027-6-7", "zh": "sapati（诅咒、发誓）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1027-8-15", "zh": "sapatho（誓言），abhisapatho（诅咒），abhisapito（被诅咒的），sapanako（诅咒者）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1028-2-4", "zh": "Vapa，表示播种。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1028-5-7", "zh": "播下种子。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1028-8-9", "zh": "vāpako（播种者）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1028-10-12", "zh": "被播下的谷物。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1028-13-16", "zh": "种子被人播下了。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1028-17-19", "zh": "种子被播下。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1028-20-21", "zh": "vappamaṅgalaṃ（播种节）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1029-2-4", "zh": "Supa，表示睡眠。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1029-5-6", "zh": "supati（睡）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1029-7-15", "zh": "不被女人束缚的牟尼们，睡得安稳。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1029-16-22", "zh": "sutto puriso（睡着的人），supanaṃ（睡眠），suttaṃ（睡眠）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1030-2-4", "zh": "Khipa，表示研磨（peraṇa）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1030-5-8", "zh": "peraṇa 就是磨碎、碾磨。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1030-9-10", "zh": "khepati（研磨）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1030-11-12", "zh": "khepako（研磨者）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1031-2-4", "zh": "Khipa，表示含糊不清的声音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1031-5-6", "zh": "khipati（打喷嚏）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1031-7-8", "zh": "khipitasaddo（打喷嚏的声音）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1031-9-16", "zh": "当世间至尊的导师说法时打了喷嚏，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1032-2-4", "zh": "Khipa，表示抛掷。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1032-5-14", "zh": "khipati（投掷），ukkhipati（举起），vikkhipati（散开），avakhipati（抛下），saṃkhipati（收拢）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1032-15-23", "zh": "khittaṃ、ukkhittaṃ、pakkhittaṃ、vikkhittaṃ 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1033-2-4", "zh": "Opa，表示吐唾。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1033-5-7", "zh": "吐唾，就是把唾液吐出来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1033-8-9", "zh": "opati（吐唾）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1033-10-15", "zh": "调配好药以后，把口中的唾液吐了出来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1034-2-4", "zh": "Lipi，表示涂抹。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1034-5-6", "zh": "lepati（涂抹）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1034-7-10", "zh": "涂满了至高的光辉。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1035-2-4", "zh": "Khipi，表示行走。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1035-5-6", "zh": "khimpati（行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1036-2-4", "zh": "Ḍipa，表示抛掷。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1036-5-6", "zh": "ḍepati（抛掷）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1037-2-4", "zh": "Nidapi，表示捋取（nidampana）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1037-5-25", "zh": "所谓捋取，是指对谷物、树木等，不割断稻穗或稗穗，也不折断小枝，就着它原本长着的样子用手抓住拉扯，只取下种子或只取下叶子。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1037-26-32", "zh": "人捋下稻穗，捋下树叶。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1037-33-40", "zh": "nidampako（捋取者），nidampitaṃ（被捋取的），nidampituṃ（为了捋取），nidampitvā（捋取以后）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1038-2-4", "zh": "Tapa，表示发光。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1038-2-5", "zh": "tapa 用于发光之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1038-6-8", "zh": "发光就是照耀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1038-9-11", "zh": "太阳在白天照耀。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1039-2-4", "zh": "Tapa，表示惊惧。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1039-5-8", "zh": "惊惧就是惶恐、畏怯。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1039-9-12", "zh": "tapati、uttapati（畏惧）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1039-13-17", "zh": "ottappaṃ（愧），ottappiyaṃ dhanaṃ（愧财）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1040-2-5", "zh": "Tapa、dhūpa，表示炙热。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1040-6-7", "zh": "tapati（炙烤）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1040-8-11", "zh": "tapodhanaṃ（以苦行为财富），ātāpo（热力）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1040-12-13", "zh": "ātāpī（热忱者）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1040-14-15", "zh": "ātapaṃ（日晒的热）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1040-16-22", "zh": "dhūpati（熏），sandhūpano（熏烤），在被动语态中作 tāpiyati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1040-23-24", "zh": "dhūpiyati（被熏）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1040-25-33", "zh": "表示行为本身时，作 tāpanaṃ、tāpo（热）、paritāpo（焦热）、santāpo（炽热）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1040-34-35", "zh": "dhūpanaṃ（熏）。", "confidence": 75}
